    "Complete principal palace exterior:actual irregular four-sided footprint,narrow south triple-entry range,broad north projection,two side pavilions,closed crossing roofscape and dark curved metal mansards,roof balustrades/chimneys,upper windows/pilasters/niches,gilded balcony rail cues,scroll gables/urns and original Atlas/globe/herm/statue cues. Include structural front terrace and native-grade adapter stairs. Full park/cascades/pools/follies,detached neighbors and optical interiors excluded.",
